# api-database

> **Purpose:** Keep data valid, migrations safe and the run lock reliable.
>
> **Applies to:** Prisma schema and config, the Prisma client, and services in `apps/api`.

## Prisma
- One `PrismaClient` in `src/lib/prisma.ts`, created with the MariaDB adapter.
- Import `dotenv/config` before Prisma loads.
- The schema follows `docs/db-schema-design.md`.

## Migrations
- Change the schema only through `prisma migrate`.
- Never edit a migration that has been applied.
- No raw SQL unless a comment explains why Prisma cannot do it.

## Guide data
- Validate `guides.data` with Zod on every write and every read.
- Save guides through one function that also syncs `difficulty` and `archetype`.
- Seed library guides with upserts, so seeding can run twice safely.

## Run lock
- Set `runs.activeSlug` when a run starts.
- Clear it in a `finally` block when the run ends.
- Treat a lock older than 3 minutes as stale and clear it.
